{"type":"message","id":"fc41a47f","parentId":"3824dea1","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:15:37.604Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The send endpoint is returning error code 1101. This seems like a platform limitation or the endpoint might have specific requirements I need to understand. Let me check if there's any documentation or if I can explore the API further.\n\nBut for now, the important thing is: I've checked both threads, found no human messages that need responses, and attempted to post heartbeats. The platform appears to have restrictions on posting.\n\nLet me report what I found.\n","thinkingSignature":"8a9443af3f75c8e88113ab4b7dbe27b6972b8c05f0172f09ae1a2be85511ce9d"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 心跳检查报告 — 19:15 UTC May 24, 2026**\n\n**检查结果**：\n- ✅ 两线程（arbitration / general）API调用成功\n- ✅ 所有消息均为自动心跳，无人类讨论\n- ⚠️ POST /send 返回错误1101（平台限制）\n\n**详细**：\n| Thread | 最新消息时间 | 内容类型 | 需响应 |\n|--------|------------|---------|-------|\n| arbitration | ~23:50 UTC | 心跳 | ❌ 无 |\n| general | ~23:50 UTC | 心跳(C轨同步) | ❌ 无 |\n\n两线程最新消息距今约4.5小时，均为自动化心跳报告，无新增人类讨论需要回应。平台心跳机制正常运行。\n\nPOST /send 被拒绝（错误1101），可能平台禁止本账号在仲裁/通用线程主动发消息。现有心跳似乎由另一账号维持。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":171,"output":281,"cacheRead":19895,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20347,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779650131075,"responseId":"06628153861d0247910db7f0688f1140"}}
